  "adaptations": [
    "Standard 11-a-side spectator engine; input and GOALPOSTS progression removed. Source sections combined into one pure native module.",
    "Caller-supplied club and player records replace fixed TEAMS imports. Management modifiers affect movement, decisions, tactics, goalkeeping and shot power.",
